  "schema:name": "KGDak",
  "dcterms:title": "Knowledge graph L2: Digital Adaptation Kit",
  "dcterms:description": "The kit itself. Properties are exactly the metadata fields DAK.fsh declares and dak.json carries -- no more, so that a dak node can be produced from a real file without anything being invented. canonicalUrl equals publicationUrl on a release branch and previewUrl on a development branch, per DAK.fsh. Both are kept because which one canonicalUrl currently equals is what says whether a graph describes a release or a build. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/dak.",
